{"product_id":"look-whos-back","title":"Look who's Back","description":"\u003cp\u003eTHE SMASH-HIT HITLER SATIRE - MORE THAN 3 MILLION COPIES SOLD  \"Incredible . . . Very funny\" ALASTAIR CAMPBELL, Book of the Year 2023 on \"The Rest is Politics\" podcast \"A brilliant book\" RUSSELL KANE  \"Brilliant and hilarious\" KEN FOLLETT  A box-office-hit film available on NETFLIX  Berlin, Summer 2011. Adolf Hitler wakes up on a patch of open ground, alive and well. Things have changed - no Eva Braun, no Nazi party, no war. Hitler barely recognises his beloved Fatherland, filled with immigrants and run by a woman.  People certainly recognise him, albeit as a flawless impersonator who refuses to break character. The unthinkable, the inevitable happens, and the ranting Hitler goes viral, becomes a YouTube star, gets his own T.V. show, and people begin to listen. But the FÃ¼hrer has another programme with even greater ambition - to set the country he finds a shambles back to rights.  Look Who's Back stunned and then thrilled 1.5 million German readers with its fearless approach to the most taboo of subjects. Naive yet insightful, repellent yet strangely sympathetic, the revived Hitler unquestionably has a spring in his step.  Translated from German by Jamie Bulloch \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:129 x 198  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Timur Vermes \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780857055385 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 384\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43601465049241,"sku":"15RB-1-9780857055385","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/511e4707b687e428129eb6bcc702ce3f.jpg?v=1710754299","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/look-whos-back","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}